// The 3025 Inner Sphere and near Periphery (Stage 12B.9): ~200 named
// systems — the house capitals, regional capitals, mercenary hubs, border
// worlds of the sourcebooks, and the Periphery states. Typed against
// domain/planet.zig `[]const Planet`.
//
// Coordinates are LY on the SUCS plane with Terra at (0, 0), positive x
// toward the Draconis/Federated border and positive y toward Rasalhague;
// they are re-encoded by hand and APPROXIMATE (// TUNE — replace with
// surveyed coordinates as they are checked). Faction keys are rows of
// data/tables/factions.zon. industry: 0–5, drives local markets and
// acquisition (ARCH §9.1/§9.8). The original 27 keys are unchanged so
// saved campaigns keep their worlds.
